
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Garmin | Recovery Reality Check</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #101820;
  color: white;
}

header {
  background: #080d12;
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #00b5e2;
}

header h1 {
  margin: 0;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}

header p {
  color: #00b5e2;
}

.container {
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 35px auto;
  padding: 20px;
}

.card {
  background: #1c2935;
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: 25px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h2 {
  margin-top: 0;
}

.score {
  font-size: 65px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #00d4a0;
  text-align: center;
}

.subtext {
  text-align: center;
  color: #a9b8c5;
}

.stats {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-around;
  text-align: center;
  gap: 15px;
}

.stats strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 23px;
  color: #00b5e2;
}

.question {
  color: #a9b8c5;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.feelings {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 20px;
}

.feeling {
  flex: 1;
  background: #2d4050;
  padding: 15px 5px;
  text-align: center;
  border-radius: 9px;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  color: #8495a3;
  font-size: 12px;
  padding: 25px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>GARMIN</h1>
  <p>RECOVERY REALITY CHECK</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Today's Recovery</h2>

    <div class="score">82</div>

    <p class="subtext">
      Your device says you're well recovered.
    </p>

    <div class="stats">
      <div>
        <strong>78</strong>
        Body Battery
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>54</strong>
        HRV Status
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>7h 48m</strong>
        Sleep
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>How Do You Actually Feel?</h2>

    <p class="question">
      Sometimes your body tells you something
      different than your wearable.
      Compare how you feel with your recovery data.
    </p>

    <div class="feelings">
      <div class="feeling">Great</div>
      <div class="feeling">Okay</div>
      <div class="feeling">Exhausted</div>
    </div>

    <p class="subtext">
      Personal recovery check-in coming soon.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>

<footer>
  Garmin Feature Concept | Student Prototype
  <p>Demo data only. Not affiliated with Garmin.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
